## Since joining the legislature in 2018,
I have been working for you.
And a just new world.
## She’s ready to drive the change we seek. With so much on the line, we don’t have time for divisiveness and dysfunction. Sydney’s a bold, effective leader who’s as strong at building consensus as she is at fighting the big fights.
And that’s just what we need: a new kind of Washington – a place we can respect. We deserve someone who can weather the storms, stand up to the attacks, work for all of the constituents of the 37th, and win. This is our chance to send in fresh leadership to Washington.
## Sydney Kamlager-Dove is the Representative for California’s 37th Congressional District in Los Angeles.
